# ---- Benchmark output (generated by scripts/bench.sh / results/) ----
# Transient raw runs land in repo-root results/ and stay untracked. The
# canonical committed dataset lives under docs/results/ (see its metadata file).
/results/
bench_results_*

# ---- One deliberately uncommitted dataset ----
# The first Phase-4 tail-latency pass is real, complete and self-validating, but
# it was measured concurrently with other work on the same host, so none of it
# is usable. It is kept on the machine that ran it, labelled and unedited, with
# its derived tables deleted. It is NOT committed: 106 MB of raw data for a run
# that cannot be cited. docs/results/README.md carries the repository's record
# of it, including why every queue-level gate passed anyway.
docs/results/spsc-tail-latency-CONTAMINATED-concurrent-load/
